{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "320b1574d272a6a0b0eda5166bb2e85a15557562446e91a43807f6889ea765b4", "ja": "フフフ……わしは、この劇場を護る神様じゃー！\nどうじゃ？　この装束、わしに似合っておるか？", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……吾乃守护这座剧场的神明！\n怎么样？这身装束适合吾吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1001_p", "source_sha256": "32fa2c878b90f86a060f32bc9f7baa5e2c2f55fd557ff82f813f4c4510225e3d", "ja": "おお、バッチリだな。\n本当に狐の神様がいるみたいだ！", "zh": "哦，非常合适。\n简直就像真的有狐仙一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "6237ad1aefd96c3cc9da254b95d35e63d405fd5893cacaf2d0ea1f63a3467ffe", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございま～……じゃなかった！\nありがとうなのじゃ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你～……不对！\n谢谢你们，呐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "47c3673caa003a5852c2826da2496c8f4093cba469fb104c621d7aa7bd10acc3", "ja": "これからも、わしはお主らを見守っておる。\n皆がトップアイドルになれるよう、頑張るのじゃぞ！", "zh": "今后，老夫也会一直守望着你们。为了让大家都能成为顶尖偶像，可要努力啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3475491bc17545e9906009f631623bbced36fbc1e75afafda91490c20151908c", "ja": "はは～、承知しました！　何があっても\n未来たちをトップアイドルにすると誓います。", "zh": "哈哈～，明白了！无论发生什么，我都发誓要让未来她们成为顶尖偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "e83132579392a76720d29a2b372c9e372f31118085cb436d2d0ed008614f28b3", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n今の言葉、本当の本当ですか！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……。\n刚才那句话，真的是真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9f20cb7d2c3124fca090264d9b5ea684a057aaf5df4737f798b314f1844186f4", "ja": "ああ、今の言葉に嘘はないよ。\nしっかりみんなを導いていけるよう、頑張るから。", "zh": "啊，我刚才说的都是真的。\n我会努力成为能够好好带领大家前进的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d3700c97d8f8fab12a5874484df6f5cec2fe40034be73a0546541a5666398f46", "ja": "それにしても……\n神様の演技、すごいサマになってるな。", "zh": "不过话说回来……你演神明还真像那么回事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "43ee5df528d3facf670efcf6540cd04ecc10aabca286e405a993bd6c5970b845", "ja": "ありがとうございまーす♪　キツネの神様の衣装って\n聞いて……なんだかやってみたくなっちゃいました！", "zh": "谢谢——♪ 听说是狐狸神明的服装……就不知不觉想试试看了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "ff30abc7a3311c43ca8fd745f3757994a19d50bb473b7e46577d72264c6443c8", "ja": "私、つい劇場の神様を名乗っちゃいましたけど……\n大丈夫ですか？　コラーって怒られたりしませんか？", "zh": "我一不小心就自称剧场神明了……没关系吧？不会被骂吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6d3c455dd1394f125a4159d824f308773d22b3d4648a11179f2342f465d860c7", "ja": "大丈夫じゃないかな……。\n未来はいると思うか？　劇場の神様。", "zh": "应该没问题吧……\n你觉得会有吗？剧场的神仙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "67d9bcc37a9bfb192465309e08c164b5cbbf97815d444e3d1ad54e37cdaa5d76", "ja": "うーん……どうだろう～？　いるような、いないような\n……でもでも、いてくれたらいいなって思います！", "zh": "嗯……怎么说呢～？感觉像是存在，又像是不存在……\n不过不过，我还是希望有这样的神明存在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "106fe0ba1932b34634dc60994ac8f412559f374f764660700c7f0b0a57814aca", "ja": "私たちのことを、いつも見守ってくれてる……\nそんな、劇場の神様！", "zh": "一直守护着我们……\n就是这样的，剧场守护神！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4dce64ceb9aa04db0d46af145a2a725e1ae742807a2f9e0ad5d1925077fec5b1", "ja": "そうだな。毎日、みんなが元気に\nアイドル活動をしてるのが、その証拠かもな。", "zh": "是啊。每天大家都精神满满地进行偶像活动，或许就是证据吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "07d09a4be85f02a1dd89aa4bb5579b9503f11a7431cf8cf361947b404f7a1e10", "ja": "そうですよね。うん……きっと、そうです！\nよ～し、それじゃ……。", "zh": "是啊。嗯……一定是这样的！\n好～，那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "381e4b28b97115aa81f5f549d91eca9aa9124b9df9dd00ce8f29e878f58a4e51", "ja": "劇場の神様！　いつも、ありがとうございます！\nこれからも私たちのこと、よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "剧场之神！一直以来，感谢您！\n今后也请继续关照我们——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "a8dfa129a54bdd06ffa98268cf8c54309b43df5e2ceab13fbeaa764c9f5dd44b", "ja": "……なんて、えへへ♪\nこの姿で、神様にお礼を言うのって、変ですかね？", "zh": "……开玩笑的啦，嘿嘿♪\n以这副打扮向神明道谢，是不是有点奇怪呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b77fdf10524463289abf708e5c06e7051a0dbbe2ec89e29779aac3ebf3adfe1d", "ja": "いや、そんなことはないよ。\nきっと神様も、喜んでくれているはずだ。", "zh": "不，没那回事。\n神明大人一定也会为此感到高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "eb2d828cdab34ca7fb20fa36dccc58c698497f36c9bad1c50f94f600cb6bb062", "ja": "そうだといいな～……ん？　あれ？\n何だか急に、元気が湧いてきたような……？", "zh": "要是那样就好了～……嗯？咦？\n总觉得突然又有精神了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d73c9eef449a18df61a7504e435a69e482662075071e0bfae0e82090df42758b", "ja": "えっ？\n……きっと、未来の声が届いたのかもしれないな。", "zh": "咦？\n……一定是未来的声音传到了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "db24f1444bbedfbb3256dd2e7ca524e1da4bdf293f76e6a86cdfd36996d91042", "ja": "はい！　気のせいかもしれないですけど、\n今なら、すごく、すーっごく頑張れる気がします！", "zh": "是！虽然也可能只是我的错觉，\n但我觉得现在一定能、能非常非常努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "7102c302a92148e43056c32bf0cd0d5fc2146245826f009610331878242aa76c", "ja": "この後はダンスレッスンなので、\nいっぱい練習するぞ～！　おーっ！", "zh": "接下来要上舞蹈课，\n我要好好练习～！　噢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0574_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0574_1022_p", "source_sha256": "d37115a13621d5d54b3fe9825dec99beea4bb9b834052ebddfc5c6b1bbaca41f", "ja": "（未来の言う通り、その日のレッスンはいつも以上に\n絶好調だった。もしかしたら本当に……なんて、な）", "zh": "（正如未来所说，那天的课程状态比平时还要好。难道真的……不，没什么。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
